  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Tokenized stocks distributed value rose 15.5% over 30D:</strong> Tokenized equity distributed value at $3.77B (15.5% higher over 30D) shows the early lane still adding balance sheet on a small set of platforms. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/10/28/mystery-wall-street-journal-ad-sparks-new-fight-over-tokenized-stocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Mystery Wall Street Journal ad sparks new fight over tokenized stocks</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Tokenized stocks remain an early-stage lane:</strong> liquidity and scale are still concentrated in a small set of platforms/networks. Related: <a href=\"https://decrypt.co/382043/jpmorgan-coca-cola-7-more-companies-objecting-okx-ice-tokenized-stocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">JPMorgan, Coca-Cola Among 7 More Companies Objecting to OKX-ICE Tokenized Stocks</a> (Decrypt).</li><li><strong>Tokenized equities remain an early access market:</strong> Liquidity and scale stay concentrated until broker distribution and custody plumbing can support broader trading. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/janus-henderson-centrifuge-launch-tokenized-nasdaq-100-fund-on-stellar?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Janus Henderson, Centrifuge launch tokenized Nasdaq-100 fund on Stellar</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Securities and broker-rule constraints often set the pace more than listing count, so near-term share stays tied to venues that can actually distribute products. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/business/2026-10-28-ripple-900-million-revenue-run-rate-rlusd-431920\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ripple expects $900 million annualized product revenue run rate as institutional business expands</a> (The Block).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
